+ * - Strictly NEVER states or displays prices, price ranges, or package costs.
+ * - Defers website/app development and training/courses to the team without claiming them as verified services.
+ * - Assists with 30-minute free discovery call / appointment requests while truthfully stating slots require team confirmation.
